  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0026","idiomatic","Gao Jifu, Attendant Drafting the Secretariat, urged: 'Junior provincial officials are destitute; they ought to receive salaries to support their families.'","Gao Jifu, Attendant Drafting the Secretariat, urged: 'Junior provincial officials are destitute; they ought to receive salaries to support their parents.'","Chinese 養親 specifically means supporting parents/elders, not households in general; replacing 'families' with 'parents' restores the source sense without other changes.","high","applied"],
    ["s0075","idiomatic","In Guangzai 1 (684), because eighth- and ninth-rank capital officials were poorly paid, the court granted eighth rank three general servants per year and ninth rank two.","In Guangzhai 1 (684), because eighth- and ninth-rank capital officials were poorly paid, the court granted eighth rank three general servants per year and ninth rank two.","The reign title 光宅 is Guangzhai; 'Guangzai' is a pinyin error. The proposed spelling and year (684) match the Chinese era name.","high","applied"],
    ["s0116","literal","Chancellor Yang Guozhong personally held several offices; beyond hall seals he was monthly given one million cash.","Chancellor Yang Guozhong personally held several offices; beyond hall-seal emoluments he was monthly given one million cash.","堂封 is the chancellor's hall emolument, not physical seals; 'hall-seal emoluments' correctly marks it as a stipend term while staying close to the literal wording.","medium","applied"]
